===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|fr|réticule}}, from {{der|en|la|reticulum}}, diminutive of {{m|la|rēte|t=net}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɹɛtɪkjuːl/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-reticule.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[reticle]]; a [[grid]] in the eyepiece of an instrument. {{defdate|from 18th c.}}
